cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CO2LOGIX 2.0, please cite the software and the accompanying paper."
title: "CO2LOGIX 2.0"
type: software
version: "2.0.1"
date-released: "2026-11-23"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/iaindejongeanderson/CO2LOGIX-2.0"
abstract: >-
  A global model of how fast CO2 geological storage can be deployed. It couples
  logistic industry growth, with drilling rates set by each country's storage
  readiness, to pressure-constrained injection in 217 basins and storage units
  across 71 countries. Version 2.0.1 accompanies the first revision of the paper.
keywords:
  - carbon capture and storage
  - CO2 geological storage
  - storage capacity
  - pressure interference
  - deployment rates
